    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        PWD: Prior-Guided and Wavelet-Enhanced <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> for Limited-Angle CT
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+Y">Yi Liu</a>, 
      
